cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "firoozbakht-cleanroom: a full-lane cosmon-fleet attack on Firoozbakht's conjecture"
message: "If you refer to this attack — the record, the trace, or the bundled spore — please cite it as below."
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "Noogram"
    website: "https://noogram.org"
abstract: >-
  A dedicated agent-fleet attack on Firoozbakht's conjecture
  (p(n+1)^(1/(n+1)) < p(n)^(1/n) for all n >= 1, an open problem on the primes),
  run as the full lane of the math-attack cosmon spore: a Lean lake-build firewall
  that authors every verdict, a citation audit, an adversarial skeptic that
  independently recomputes claims, and a red-team. Nothing here claims to settle
  the conjecture; the record documents an honest attack, benchmarked against a
  single strong model run solo on the same mission.
keywords:
  - cosmon
  - spore
  - agent fleet
  - math-attack
  - Firoozbakht's conjecture
  - prime numbers
  - Lean 4
  - formal verification
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/noogram-labs/firoozbakht-cleanroom"
